@Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5288

### Alle Produkte abrufen
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Neues Produkt anlegen
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testprodukt",
  "price": 9.99,
  "stock": 10
}

### Ungültiges Produkt anlegen (sollte 400 liefern)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "stock": 0
}

### Produkt aktualisieren (Id anpassen!)
PUT {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testprodukt (bearbeitet)",
  "price": 12.50,
  "stock": 5
}

### Produkt löschen (Id anpassen!)
DELETE {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/products/1